<title>USA: Stockpile restates aluminum left for sale in FY97.</title>
<headline>Stockpile restates aluminum left for sale in FY97.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center issued an amendment to its aluminum solicitation to restate the amount of metal left for sale in the current fiscal year which ends September 30.</p>
<p>There will be 41,484 short tons of aluminum for sale, the stockpile said. The next bid opening is on June 3.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
